5,1,1,talk,Victoria,,"Since we've outgrown our current layout, I think we should be thorough. I'll look into the basis of the department's floor billing and the facilities quote for re-running power and network.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Minato,,I want to know about the sound meter readings across the room and the physio's note from the workstation check.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,May,,I'll check the morning routine on the pilot floor upstairs and the unplanned seat shuffles in the past year. I want to see how much time we're actually losing.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,I'll take the drawn plan against the staff survey and the arrival times in the badge records. It's better to see who actually gets what before we decide.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I'll look into the two project strands within earshot last spring and what this year's two joiners reported.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,pass,Victoria,,Skip,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false}"
11,1,2,pass,Minato,,Skip,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,May,,Does anyone else think we should check the sound readings? I'm curious if the noise levels affect how we use the gaps in our schedules.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@May, Minato already has that covered. I think we have a good spread of data points for now.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""May"",""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,I agree with Shunichi. I think we have enough different perspectives covered to make a fair decision.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,pass,Victoria,,Skip,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Minato,,I'm happy to share what I find with everyone later. I just want to make sure we're all comfortable.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,May,,"That's sweet, Minato. I'm just worried about the chaos of moving. I hope the data on those unplanned shuffles shows it's not as disruptive as I remember.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,"Disruption is inevitable, but ignorance of it is what makes it frustrating. I'm more interested in whether the current ""luck of the draw"" is actually fair.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,"I just hope we can find a way to make sure everyone feels included, regardless of where they sit.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Victoria,,I agree. Let's proceed with these choices so we can analyze the facts and reach a rational conclusion together.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
